  triage:closureNote "2026-07-27 (quality-mgr): independently re-verified at integrate/phase-AI@f3b6a77a — docs/project-plan.md:978 now has 'AI.11 | route-specific HTTP bodies and Windows loopback-TCP local transport' row; the original 'no AI.11 entry, table jumps AI.7->AI.10' complaint no longer holds. Separate observation, NOT part of this finding's original claim and not blocking its closure: the row's status column still reads 'in progress' though AI.11 has long since merged forward through many later sprints (s27+) -- that staleness is a new, distinct doc-status defect; filing a fresh finding if not already tracked elsewhere is appropriate, but does not reopen this one. Confirmed via direct grep of current file, not self-report." ;
